{"change_summary":"No additional code changes were required in this Apply Fixes pass. The prior amendments already delivered the habitat-aware, saturating root-zone oxygenation path, reused the computed `SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown` for tracing, and added the requested rootable-area clarification comment; the subsequent review approved the implementation with no blocking follow-up.","outstanding_risks":["Cross-crate workspace tests were not rerun in this stage; validation remains scoped to `tank_core`, which contains the touched implementation.","The remaining review notes are non-blocking cleanup opportunities: initialization-time code still discards the returned breakdown, and `root_oxygenation_active_biomass_g()` still recomputes the habitat registry internally."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the approved review results and confirm whether any blocking follow-up fixes were requested for the root-zone oxygenation work.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply additional code changes for review follow-up items.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Record the approved validation state for the substrate, root-zone oxygenation, denitrification, and lint coverage.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["Review outcome was `approved` with no blocking amendments required.","Approved review confirmed `cargo test -p tank_core` passed across all unit and integration test binaries.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib systems::substrate::tests -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test root_zone_oxygenation -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test denitrification -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core` produced zero warnings."]}